#: src/Scan/Explain.php:176
msgid "Get the value another way."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:181
msgid "A parameter has a type and a default of null, but its type doesn't say it can be null. PHP 8.4 wants that written out."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:182
msgid "Put a ? in front of the type."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:189
msgid "A function has an optional parameter before a required one, so the default can never be used."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:190
msgid "Remove the default from the earlier parameter, or move the optional parameters to the end."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:197
msgid "A constructor calls exit() or die(). Since PHP 8.0 the object's destructor no longer runs after that."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:198
msgid "Usually nothing to do. If clean-up happens in __destruct(), do it before exiting."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:203
msgid "Uses \"integer\", \"boolean\" or \"double\" as a type. PHP reads that as a class name, not as int, bool or float."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:204
msgid "Use the short type name."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:212
msgid "A static closure uses $this, which a static closure never has. PHP throws an Error when it runs, on every version."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:213
msgid "Remove \"static\" from the closure, or don't use $this inside it."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:219
msgid "A closure uses $this where there may be no object to point to."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:220
msgid "Check the closure is created inside a class method, or pass the object in with use ()."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:225
msgid "Calls implode() with its two arguments the wrong way round. PHP 7.4 warned about it; PHP 8.0 stops with a fatal error."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:226
msgid "Put the separator first."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:233
msgid "Calls trigger_error() with E_USER_ERROR, which PHP 8.4 deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:234
msgid "Throw an exception instead, or stop with wp_die() in WordPress code."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:241
msgid "Calls get_class() with no argument inside a class, which PHP 8.3 deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:242
msgid "Use self::class (or static::class for the actual class)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:249
msgid "Calls fgetcsv(), fputcsv() or str_getcsv() without the $escape argument. Its default is changing, so PHP 8.4 wants it passed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:250
msgid "Pass the escape character: an empty string for standard CSV, or a backslash to keep today's behaviour."
msgstr ""

#: src/Scan/Explain.php:257
